    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Glide into Melee with Panache and Agility</p></blockquote><p>As a Swashbuckler, you focus on the art of the blade, bringing speed, elegance, and charm to your fighting style—topped off with an exquisite flourish of panache. You excel in single combat, and your methods make a duel look like a flamboyant performance.</p><h3>Swashbuckler Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.DOwcjzNliWaAhB8y]{Fancy Footwork}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.YICHfqLX5vG71Yvg]{Rakish Audacity}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.PxLAYSfgHnZfDdeM]{Panache}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.EKM8xATQEAQ7s3eV]{Dashing Strikes}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.GwUg0l2Eta32xGJu]{Master Duelist}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
